{"sha": "bb07faee84a0c978cd77e236607ee039d24a4781d0bcac8fa1c65ed2ec54d4da", "body": ["\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g10:algebra:signtable}", "求 $P(x) = (x - 2)(3 - x)$ 的符号。因式 $x - 2$ 在 $2$ 处为零，之后为", "正；因式 $3 - x$ 在 $3$ 处为零，之前为正：", "\\begin{center}", "\\renewcommand{\\arraystretch}{1.3}", "\\begin{tabular}{c|ccccc}", "$x$ & $-\\infty$ \\quad & $2$ & & $3$ & \\quad $+\\infty$ \\\\", "\\hline", "$x - 2$ & $-$ & $0$ & $+$ & & $+$ \\\\", "$3 - x$ & $+$ & & $+$ & $0$ & $-$ \\\\", "\\hline", "$P(x)$ & $-$ & $0$ & $+$ & $0$ & $-$ \\\\", "\\end{tabular}", "\\end{center}", "由此可知 $P(x) > 0$ 恰在 $\\intoo{2}{3}$ 上成立，且 $P(x) \\leq 0$ 在", "$\\intoc{-\\infty}{2} \\cup \\intco{3}{+\\infty}$ 上成立。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis,", "  width=8.2cm, height=5.2cm,", "  xmin=-0.6, xmax=5.4, ymin=-2.6, ymax=1.4,", "  xtick={2,3}, ytick=\\empty]", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=0.35:4.65] {(x-2)*(3-x)};", "  \\fill (axis cs:2,0) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\fill (axis cs:3,0) circle (1.5pt);", "  \\node[omDef, font=\\small] at (axis cs:2.5,0.65) {$P > 0$};", "  \\node[omThm, font=\\small] at (axis cs:0.9,-1.3) {$P < 0$};", "  \\node[omThm, font=\\small] at (axis cs:4.1,-1.3) {$P < 0$};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 函数 $P(x) = (x-2)(3-x)$ 的图像印证了符号表：在根 $2$ 与 $3$ 之间", "为正，在两根之外为负。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{method}[用符号表解不等式]\\label{met:g10:algebra:signtable}", "求解形如 $E(x) \\geq 0$ 或 $E(x) < 0$ 的不等式：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 将所有项移至左边，使右边为", "        $0$（切勿两边同乘符号未知的", "        式子）；", "  \\item 将左边因式分解；若左边为分式，则", "        通分。", "  \\item 按每个因式一行列出符号表（若为商，则在最后一行", "        用双竖线标出禁止取值）；", "  \\item 读出所求符号成立的区间，并检验", "        每个端点是否属于解集。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:g10:algebra:quotientineq}", "解 $\\dfrac{x + 1}{x - 3} \\leq 0$。分子在 $-1$ 处为零，分母", "在 $3$ 处为零（禁止值）。商在两者符号相反时为负，", "这发生于 $x$ 介于 $-1$ 与 $3$ 之间时。", "包含使\\emph{分子}为零的端点，但排除", "禁止值：解集为 $\\intco{-1}{3}$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g10:algebra:1}", "展开并化简：", "\\[", "3(2x - 5) - 2(x - 7), \\qquad", "(x + 4)(2x - 1), \\qquad", "(3x - 2)^2, \\qquad", "(5 - x)(5 + x).", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g10:algebra:2}", "因式分解：", "\\[", "x^2 - 49, \\qquad", "x^2 + 10x + 25, \\qquad", "7x^2 - 14x, \\qquad", "16x^2 - 8x + 1 .", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g10:algebra:3}", "解方程：", "\\[", "4x + 9 = x - 3, \\qquad", "\\frac{2x - 1}{3} = 5, \\qquad", "2(x - 3) = 2x + 1 .", "\\]", "（其中有一个方程无解 --- 请说明理由。）", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g10:algebra:4}", "利用零乘积法则解方程：", "\\[", "(x + 5)(2x - 8) = 0, \\qquad", "x^2 - 16 = 0, \\qquad", "x^2 + 6x + 9 = 0 .", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:g10:algebra:5}", "解下列不等式，并用区间表示解集：", "\\[", "3x - 5 \\leq 7, \\qquad", "-4x + 1 > 9, \\qquad", "2(x - 1) \\geq 5x + 4 .", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}